//------------------------------------------------------------------
// Rules
//------------------------------------------------------------------

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_RulesPrompt
What would you like to know\nabout the [BUFFER1]?

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_ChoiceFrontierRules
Frontier Rules

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_ChoiceFacilityRules
Facility Rules

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_CommonRules
At the Battle Frontier, you'll take\non challengers one after another.\pEvery Pok\emon battles at level 50\nand is healed before each fight.\pAs you win, your streak will grow\nand you'll face stronger trainers.\pYou'll earn Pok\e Chips for each win.\nJust remember you can only hold\lup to 999 Pok\e Chips at a time!\pIf you ever need a break, you can\nRest - we'll save your streak and\lhold it until you return.\pPlease make sure to complete a\nbattle before resting - otherwise\lyour streak will be lost!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_TowerRules
The Battle Tower emphasizes\ntraditionl battles - no gimmicks.\pJust you, your team, and one\nchallenger after another.

